{"id":"libe_re_","lemma":"libéré","pos":"adj","rank":1977,"glosses":["freed, liberated, released (made free, set at liberty)","discharged, freed, released (discharged from a debt, from a servitude)"],"forms":{"feminine":"libérée","masculinePlural":"libérés","femininePlural":"libérées"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-VictorDtmtc-lib%C3%A9r%C3%A9.wav","examples":[{"text":"Quand sera-t-il libéré ?","en":"When will he be freed?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"he / it"},null]},{"text":"Les prisonniers ont été libérés.","en":"The prisoners were set free.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"prisoner","l":"prisonnier"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},null]},{"text":"Les otages seront libérés demain.","en":"The hostages will be released tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"hostage","l":"otage"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"tomorrow"}]},{"text":"Après le procès, ils ont libéré les prisonniers.","en":"After the trial, they freed the prisoners.","words":[{"g":"after"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"lawsuit"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"prisoner","l":"prisonnier"}]},{"text":"Ces prisonnières ont été libérées hier.","en":"Those prisoners were set free yesterday.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"prisoner","l":"prisonnier"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},null,{"g":"yesterday"}]}]}